    "markdown": "![Hugging Face's logo](https://huggingface.co/front/assets/huggingface_logo-noborder.svg) Hugging Face⟨1⟩\n  *  Models ⟨2⟩\n  *  Datasets ⟨3⟩\n  *  Spaces ⟨4⟩\n  *  Buckets new⟨5⟩\n  *  Docs ⟨6⟩\n  *  Enterprise ⟨7⟩\n  * Pricing⟨8⟩\n  *     * Website\n      *  Tasks⟨9⟩\n      *  HuggingChat⟨10⟩\n      *  Collections⟨11⟩\n      *  Languages⟨12⟩\n      *  Organizations⟨13⟩\n    * Community\n      *  Blog⟨14⟩\n      *  Posts⟨15⟩\n      *  Daily Papers⟨16⟩\n      *  Hardware⟨17⟩\n      *  Learn⟨18⟩\n      *  Discord⟨19⟩\n      *  Forum⟨20⟩\n      *  GitHub⟨21⟩\n    * Solutions\n      *  Team & Enterprise⟨7⟩\n      *  Hugging Face PRO⟨22⟩\n      *  Enterprise Support⟨23⟩\n      *  Inference Providers⟨24⟩\n      *  Inference Endpoints⟨25⟩\n      *  Storage Buckets⟨5⟩\n  * * * *\n  * Log In⟨26⟩\n  * Sign Up⟨27⟩\n\n\n# \n ![](https://huggingface.co/avatars/0e429583e1c04d70ee246a8da5ff4c7d.svg) ⟨28⟩\nSamarthBuilds⟨28⟩\n/\ndesi-dictation-models⟨29⟩\nlike 0\n Model card ⟨29⟩ Files Files and versions xet ⟨30⟩ Community ⟨31⟩\nCopy to bucket new\n**YAML Metadata Warning:** empty or missing yaml metadata in repo card\nCheck out the documentation⟨32⟩ for more information.\n  * Desi Dictation Models⟨33⟩\n\n\n#   ⟨33⟩ Desi Dictation Models \nGGML conversions (for whisper.cpp) of open speech models, served to the Desi Dictation macOS app.  \n| File  | Base model  | License  |  \n| --- | --- | --- |  \n| ggml-hinglish-apex-q5_0.bin  | Oriserve/Whisper-Hindi2Hinglish-Apex⟨34⟩  | Apache 2.0  |  \n| ggml-hinglish-swift.bin  | Oriserve/Whisper-Hindi2Hinglish-Swift⟨35⟩  | Apache 2.0  |  \n| ggml-vaani-hindi-q5_0.bin  | ARTPARK-IISc/whisper-large-v3-vaani-hindi⟨36⟩  | Apache 2.0  |  \nConverted with whisper.cpp⟨37⟩ convert-h5-to-ggml.py + q5_0 quantization. Full credit to the original model authors. Downloads last month\n    \n-     \nDownloads are not tracked for this model. How to track ⟨38⟩\nInference Providers NEW⟨39⟩\nThis model isn't deployed by any Inference Provider. 🙋 Ask for provider support⟨40⟩\nSystem theme\nCompany\nTOS⟨41⟩ Privacy⟨42⟩ About⟨43⟩ Careers⟨44⟩ ⟨1⟩\nWebsite\nModels⟨2⟩ Datasets⟨3⟩ Spaces⟨4⟩ Pricing⟨8⟩ Docs⟨6⟩\nInference providers allow you to run inference using different serverless providers.\n",
